  "releaseNotes": "2.6.2 - Same engine as Cocos2D-Mono 2.6.2: no API changes, and the packaged platforms behave as in 2.6.1.\n2.6.1 - Same engine as Cocos2D-Mono 2.6.1: Linux/macOS label fixes (the native Skia canvas and font are disposed on each redraw; deprecated SkiaSharp text APIs retired). No API changes.\n- See https://github.com/Cocos2D-Mono/cocos2d-mono for the full changelog.",
